     [38;5;246mStore { id, username }; id is the username now, becomes the server id later. Consumers read .id from day one, so [39m
     [38;5;246mthe API landing changes only the store.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m Username only
     [38;5;246mStore just the string. Simplest thing that works. Every consumer changes when a real user id arrives.[39m
  [38;5;246m3.[39m Real server id now
